  "description": "Quack! is a fast, lightweight, and user-friendly 2D/3D game engine built on SDL and its extensions (SDL_image, SDL_mixer, SDL_ttf). It is designed for modern .NET 9+ games and applications. It provides a clean, flexible and intuitive API that simplifies game development by hiding low-level complexities. It offers a range of features such as rendering (SDL_renderer and SDL_gpu), input handling, audio playback, resource management, window management, and more.",
